# NOGLUTEATALY project notes

- Goal: rebuild nogluteataly.com in Next.js/React. UI redesign comes later; keep content and routes, not Elementor styling.
- Source dump is `nogluteataly.com/`. Do not import WordPress CSS/JS into the Next app.
- Content of record: `content/site.ts`, `content/tours.ts`, `content/faq.ts`, `content/posts.json`.
- Header already existed and uses `site.nav` from `@/content/site`.
- Keep the memory-bank files updated after significant changes.
